  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the following molecules,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0264_09849fd9048c.png\" style=\"width: 236px; height: 116px;\" /></p><p>Hybridisation of carbon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> respectively&nbsp;are :</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>sp</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>sp</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>sp</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>sp</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
